  <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <div class="meta">CUDD Energy Services — TMV Preventive Maintenance SMS Program · Effective date: July 23, 2026</div>

  <h2>1. Program Description</h2>
  <p>By opting in, you agree to receive SMS messages from CUDD Energy Services regarding TMV preventive-maintenance dispatch, work-order assignments, and completion requests through the TMV Preventive Maintenance application (<code>https://tmvapp.local-journal.com</code>).</p>

  <h2>2. Consent</h2>
  <p>Consent is provided when a technician adds their mobile number to their profile in the TMV PM app and confirms the "Receive SMS work-order alerts" opt-in, or by texting an opt-in keyword. Consent is not a condition of purchase or employment.</p>

  <h2>3. Message Frequency</h2>
  <p>Message frequency varies with assigned work — typically 1–10 messages per day per technician. Frequency is not fixed and depends on operational dispatch volume.</p>

  <h2>4. Rates &amp; Carriers</h2>
  <p>Message and data rates may apply based on your mobile carrier plan. Supported carriers include AT&amp;T, Verizon, T-Mobile, and other major US carriers. CUDD Energy Services is not responsible for carrier delays or non-delivery.</p>

  <h2>5. Opt-Out</h2>
  <p>You may opt out at any time: reply <code>STOP</code> to any message to cancel, or disable SMS in your app profile. Upon opt-out you will receive one final confirmation and no further messages. Reply <code>HELP</code> for help.</p>

  <h2>6. Supported Commands</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>STOP</code> — opt out of all messages.</li>
    <li><code>HELP</code> — receive assistance contact information.</li>
    <li><code>START</code> / <code>SUBSCRIBE</code> — re-opt-in if previously opted out.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Liability &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>SMS notifications are provided for operational coordination. CUDD Energy Services is not liable for missed, delayed, or misrouted messages. Technicians remain responsible for following official work-order procedures regardless of SMS receipt.</p>

  <h2>8. Privacy</h2>
  <p>Your phone number and message data are handled per our Privacy Policy at <code>https://tmvapp.local-journal.com/privacy.html</code>.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>For help, reply <code>HELP</code> to a message or contact the PM app administrator through the dispatcher console.</p>

